# LeakSanitizer suppressions.
#
# Keep this list tiny and specific. Suppressing by name keeps the leak check
# meaningful for our own code; turning detect_leaks off would not.

# NeuralAudio registers its model definitions once, into a static table it
# never tears down. 32 bytes in 4 allocations, fixed regardless of how many
# models are loaded - confirmed by loading six and still seeing four.
# Upstream's choice, and harmless: it is allocated once at first load and lives
# as long as the process.
leak:EnsureModelDefsAreLoaded
